<span id="S2.T1.5.1.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Backdoor review for GNNs with trigger hiding.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S2.T1.5.1.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S2.T1.5.1.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:69.0pt;">
<span id="S2.T1.5.1.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Graph-specific; no curvature focus.</span>
</span></td>
