<th id="S2.T1.5.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Lipschitz Robustness in Hyperbolic NNs <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib17" title="" class="ltx_ref">Li et al. (2024)</a></cite></th>
<td id="S2.T1.5.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S2.T1.5.1.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:86.3pt;">
